      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.45,
      "end_seconds": 37.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.43,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 57.8,
      "end_seconds": 71.83,
      "duration_seconds": 14.03,
      "text": "Okay: respiratory rate 17, pulse is 78 beats a minute, BP is 126 over 80. Has this been going on for long? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 73.68,
      "end_seconds": 87.51,
      "duration_seconds": 13.83,
      "text": "actually, you know, hm. It was either the end of last month or earlier than that. I couldn't tell you the the date"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.94,
      "end_seconds": 88.64,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "sure"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 90.29,
      "end_seconds": 94.46,
      "duration_seconds": 4.17,
      "text": "I've also had raw areas where blisters burst"
